  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "1.25 cups white sugar, divided",
    "1 stick unsalted butter, room temperature",
    "2 large eggs",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1.3333333730698 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.25 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 cup sour cream",
    "1 (16 ounce) package fresh strawberries, stemmed and halved"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease an 8-inch round cake pan with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aExHar23hVKF7DVyWopcprxb7ks=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/273169-french-strawberry_cake-VAT-007-Step1-C-1-a7375338847d43b98a8b8a223ff6b4ff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273169/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat together 1 cup sugar and butter in a large bowl using an electric mixer until pale and fluffy, 5 to 7 minutes. Add eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition. Beat in vanilla until incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rcmY9MJ7ESMZTTgRKqW_mJY3QY0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/273169-french-strawberry_cake-VAT-009-Step2-1-389426f7d89e4b9cae35ee80f239041f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273169/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together flour, baking powder, and salt in a medium bowl. Add flour mixture to butter mixture alternately with sour cream, beginning and ending with flour mixture. Beat until just combined after each addition.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Oc7D8dp_gKY9n_ldLAbvtsFSf68=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/273169-french-strawberry_cake-VAT-010-Step3-B-1-81c16e003e0b4427b98ea1bbe8fbec9f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273169/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold in strawberries.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4kZLVNf8moYPnkz4sSwV_8TjrWg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/273169-french-strawberry_cake-VAT-011_Step4-A-1-910e2c9b8d5142c184aefc31be58fdb5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273169/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread batter into the prepared cake pan. Sprinkle remaining 1/4 cup sugar evenly over the top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pcvaAfXXn1XbsEowXkakmjBe-bM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/273169-french-strawberry_cake-VAT-010-Step4-B-1-71c5d3b9b0e84f08a019694311026dd4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273169/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, 40 to 50 minutes. Let cool completely on a wire rack. Slice and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BJ40Ca0bQJRdHha8pUxzc80j1aA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/273169-french-strawberry_cake-VAT-012-Step5-1-ed75c2741a934ca589af6861a5d085c8.jpg"
      ],
